    "post": "200+ healthcare VC funds in the US. One place. 🔥\n\nSeed -> late-stage. AI, medtech, diagnostics, biotech, digital health.\n\nAfter days of digging and cleaning, we compiled a structured database of 200+ healthcare-focused VC funds across the US.\n\nInside the list you'll find:\n-> Fund name & website\n-> HQ state\n-> LinkedIn profile\n-> Funding focus (AI, medtech, diagnostics, biotech, devices, digital health)\n-> Stage (seed → late-stage)\n-> Investment geography\n\nIf you're raising, benchmarking investors, or mapping the market for partnerships - this cuts weeks of research into minutes.\n\nIf a fund is missing or misclassified, DM me. We'll fix it.\n\nDrop \"VC\" in the comments and make sure we're connected - I'll send you the link.",
