    "why": "Hundreds of tiny examples in one picture look like a huge amount of value.",
    "picture": "A cream page with a brand name and the title \"Winning [things] swipe file\". Under it, a wall of 80 small screenshots. Black bar at the bottom: \"Comment [WORD] and I'll send it over\".",
    "text": "\"[Brand], [brand] & [brand] spent millions testing their [ads].\" / \"I pulled their [N] best into one swipe file, plus the prompts to turn them into yours. Giving it away for free\".",
    "author": "Ahad Shams",
