    "height": 900,
    "post": "SKIMS, NIKE & AG1 SPENT MILLIONS TESTING THEIR META ADS.\n\nI pulled their 314 best ads into one swipe file, plus the Claude prompts to turn them into yours. Giving it away for free 👇\n\nMeta doesn't show anyone's spend or ROAS.\n\nBut it does show 3 signals that only appear when an ad is making money:\n\n→ How many people it reached\n→ How long it's been running\n→ How many times the brand duplicated it\n\nNobody keeps paying for a loser.\n\nSo I ranked every ad by those 3 signals.\n\n148 ran 30+ days.\n42 got cloned 5+ times.\nOne Nike ad has been live for 549 days.\n\nHere's what's inside:\n\n1. The Ad Library\nAll 314 ads from SKIMS, Nike, rhode, AG1 and Bloom.\nFilter by angle, sort by days running.\n\n2. The breakdown\nEvery ad tagged with its hook, angle and format.\nPlus why it works and how to steal it.\n\n3. The 5 playbooks\nOne per brand. What they repeat, and 3 moves to steal from each.\n\n4. The Claude prompt pack\n6 prompts that break down any winner, find the patterns and write your next 10 ads.\n\n5. The HeyOz briefs\nClaude turns those concepts into prompts you paste straight into HeyOz.\nStatics and videos in your brand. No shoot, no editor.\n\n6. The 7-day plan\nFrom picking 10 ads on Day 1 to your first test live on Day 6.\n\n7. The part that stays yours\nYour product, your proof, your offer.\nSteal the structure, never the ad.\n\nThey paid for the testing.\nYou get the results.\n\nGiving away the full swipe file for free below 👇",
