    "picture": "A simple horizontal bar chart from the study on white: what helps on the right, what hurts on the left.",
    "text": "\"I just read a study of [N] [things], and my favorite finding is that [surprise].\" / \"More on that in a sec.\" Then the findings as bullets.",
    "author": "Amanda Natividad",
    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/amandanat_i-just-read-a-study-of-116000-linkedin-posts-activity-7516575064461430785-a5vQ",
